  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **So Live**: back after 37 archived shows (740 days) [3]\n- **Cash's Dream**: back after 35 archived shows (736 days) [3]\n- **Brother Soul *$**: back after 207 archived shows (3961 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Right On *$**: back after 235 archived shows (4403 days) [3]\n- **Bewildered**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Don't Change**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Gimmme A Sign**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Layaway**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2014-03-13.cmc621xt.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 16 songs; 133 min [1]\n- **soulive2014-03-13.cmc621xt.flac16**: audience recording; 16 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Shady Horns joined the band: Ryan Zoidis on sax, James Casey on sax, and Eric Bloom on trumpet [1]\n- Shady Horns (Zoidis, Casey, Bloom) sat in, and Nigel Hall also guested, per the marked setlist [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2014-03-13.cmc621xt.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps cmc621xt mics, on-stage in wide ORTF, through Sonosax preamp, Apogee converter and Sound Devices 744T at 24-bit/96kHz; Transfer used SoundForge Pro for normalizing and fades, then CDWav to FLAC; recorded, tracked and posted by Eric McRoberts [1]\n- **soulive2014-03-13.cmc621xt.flac16**: taped by Eric Mcroberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [2]. Also: Recorded, tracked and posted by Eric McRoberts, then processed in SoundForge Pro and CDWav before FLAC encoding [2]",
